idlang-backend
# `go build ./...` inside backend/ writes a binary named after the module
# (github.com/adole/idlang), so the artifact is backend/idlang — not
# `idlang-backend`, which matches nothing. A 7.8 MB unstripped ELF was tracked as
# a result: every build dirtied the tree, `COPY . .` shipped it into images, and
# the committed copy went stale against the source beside it.
backend/idlang

